(text "C3 | NINE RECEIVER-POWERED DIGITAL LANES" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f2ca279f-e796-5284-9853-ddb95e7a7502"))
(text "A rail = MCU 3.3 V; B rail = AFE DVDD. This is not galvanic isolation." (at 15.24 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "3022644d-1dad-5bce-92dc-d26596ee682b"))
(text "OE low disables outputs; low defaults require the populated receiver-side pull resistors, not Hi-Z alone." (at 15.24 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "16cec3f9-f1d6-5da8-bf6d-24d002f231fd"))
(text "C107/C108 and other bypasses are distinct physical parts despite shared net labels; placement review follows layout." (at 15.24 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "c1dd43fd-8620-58a6-a2fd-f861cc5f2674"))
(text "AFE seven control pulls: 42.2 kohm, 1% (coordinated C3 migration). MCU reverse-lane pulls R114/R115 also 42.2 kohm." (at 15.24 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9d61d4e7-bfaa-5f22-a851-28a06953f2ff"))
(text "Static DC budget is conditional on 3.0-3.6 V, 20-30 C and <=1 uA extra board leakage. No ramp/fault-current guarantee." (at 15.24 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "50405491-2142-58f0-a180-791d772b4076"))
(text "R116 is a 100k bleed, not a fast discharge circuit. Broken feeds, ground loss and stored charge remain release blockers." (at 15.24 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "c9adb6bc-f186-5314-8db5-8b9c382ef8df"))
